-08T00:00:00Z","speed":1}],"beats":[{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:00Z","text":"Delhi chokes on most polluted Diwali eve in 10 years, DW reports.","cites":["news:dw:b4ed1b7f6c06"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:10Z","text":"Inflation in India was 2.4% in 2025, down from 6.7% in 2022.","cites":["wb:FP.CPI.TOTL.ZG:IN"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:19Z","text":"The economy grew 7.6% in 2025; unemployment stood at 4.2%.","cites":["wb:NY.GDP.MKTP.KD.ZG:IN","wb:SL.UEM.TOTL.ZS:IN"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:28Z","text":"Across South Asia, India's 2.4% compares with a median of 2.7%; the highest is Bangladesh at 8.8%.","cites":["wb:FP.CPI.TOTL.ZG:region:south-asia"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:42Z","text":"1 November: Four workers are killed after entering a food waste tank at a hotel in Ujjain, Madhya Pradesh, India.","cites":["wiki:2026-11-01:4"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:49Z","text":"2 November: Eight people are killed after they were electrocuted when a vehicle comes into contact with a high-voltage power line in Jhunjhunu, Rajasthan, India.","cites":["wiki:2026-11-02:11"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:57Z","text":"3 November: Two helicopters operated by Air Dynasty and Fishtail Air collide while landing in Solukhumbu District, Nepal, near Mount Everest, killing an Indian tourist and injuring a New Zealand national.","cites":["wiki:2026-11-03:5"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:01:04Z","text":"9 November: India’s night lights up for Diwali, Al Jazeera reported.","cites":["news:aljazeera:d453b3f9734b"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:01:18Z","text":"Homes and temples glow across India to mark Diwali, BBC News reports.","cites":["news:bbc:67ce803de4cd"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:01:32Z","text":"India, officially the Republic of India, is a country in South Asia.","cites":["wiki:rev:1383963263:0"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:01:43Z","text":"DW headlined it: “India: Delhi chokes on most polluted Diwali eve in 10 years”","cites":["news:dw:b4ed1b7f6c06"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:01:54Z","text":"Sources: 3 outlets, Wikipedia articles, Wikimedia pa